# protocol/09 § DMs through the composition root (fix wave I19): a group DM's participant whose
# device holds no KeyPackage when the DM's text group is registered cannot be added then - the
# registration's own sync (AfterRegister) finds nothing to propose for it - and is added once it
# publishes: the KeyPackage route's AfterKeyPackages hook runs SyncUserDMs, which proposes the
# device. The instance runs the production seams. `advance_clock 0s` waits for the registration's
# hook, so the Add the Go harness then finds for bob's device is the publish hook's. The Go
# harness asserts that instance Add in the store (a scenario verb cannot wait for it).
instance dilla
client alice
client bob key_packages=none
channel d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7 members=alice,bob
group dm kind=text target=d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7 community=none creator=alice
advance_clock 0s
publish_key_packages bob 2
